"id\":94810,\"title\":\"Adventure Time: Distant Lands\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qoxFg9236pkpkBuUbqudPTIHlnW.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.3346341463414635,\"_genreOverlap\":4},{\"id\":60789,\"title\":\"Monsters vs. Aliens\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ktmwzcWou5vCyqDnRJXih812XGI.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.3293750000000001,\"_genreOverlap\":4},{\"id\":94605,\"title\":\"Arcane\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/87C0wecB8bHb1PsrKBI4kJiEkgV.jpg\",\"rating\":8.7,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.17500000000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":441,\"title\":\"Father of the Pride\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eJ8kqnWfgeYb1XyKmRXCBs599pa.jpg\",\"rating\":5.1,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.17125000000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":280853,\"title\":\"喜羊羊与灰太狼之奇侠大营救\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kSKWjxNR59gY2LReeS3F1WDQ9I2.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.16000000000000003,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":211508,\"title\":\"Legendary Twins\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fp2fJYBfq6GUT3MXeG62V3aUdXc.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.16000000000000003,\"_genreOverlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"Season 4\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lM2P4rFFTQbS6rTnJfthEBnrszr.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2015-08-31\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"A Suspicious Friend\",\"overview\":\"A rumor about a monster living in the forest puts everyone on edge. But when the residents investigate, they learn the truth is a lot less scary.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yZadRA1n02kvjfBRtxCOnddJhyJ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-08-31\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"It's Good to Tidy Up\",\"overview\":\"It's Spooky's day off, and he really wants someone to come over and play. But because his place is so messy, nobody wants to go.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uSqAjngnygOqSe9jqGuAj6npeTs.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-01\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"I'm Going to Do Whatever I Want\",\"overview\":\"Bruny wants to do things his way and ignore the safety rules. But after he gets stuck in a tree, he might be ready to change his tune.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eCq1lGbMMcOit8G0Ee52tpwq7Qa.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-07\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Helly’s Wish\",\"overview\":\"Envious of his friends, Helly trades his propeller for wheels. But when Camp needs a helicopter rescue, Helly sees why flying is so important.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nlUTigoVekbZpgB8ufPxh6661ys.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-08\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"We Look Alike\",\"overview\":\"Confusion sweeps through Brooms Town when Mr. Builder borrows some of Mr. Wheeler's clothes and the two discover they look a lot alike.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/knZY9xQUoTZEbTW1MFA3VlqATeh.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-14\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Marine’s Dream\",\"overview\":\"When Lifty and Terry hear that Marine has never been camping, they conspire to give their waterbound friend the surprise of a lifetime.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eIe2lbwrpaAIlKifoht3zIvCN1S.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-15\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"The Unpoppable Bubble\",\"overview\":\"While playing with Jin's new bubble invention, Mickey accidentally starts to float away. It's up to the Rescue Team to think fast and find a solution.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8u2FRJIaKrW9qXlU44ldy45NfSO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-21\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"A Spring Cleaning Disaster\",\"overview\":\"While working to clean up Brooms Town, Posty accidentally tosses his beloved stamp collection. Now, he must find it before it's lost forever.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vZwLKv5ahOr60P6X3pS98yhmPFx.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-22\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Where's Bruny?\",\"overview\":\"Bruner asks Max to look after Bruny. But when Max gets distracted, Bruny disappears. The Rescue Team must do what it takes to find their missing pal.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pT68TKXTxcQQv1p2nhuVcSQta0N.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-28\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"The Fortune Cookie\",\"overview\":\"A message inside a fortune cookie inspires Spooky and Lifty to travel westward. Little do the friends know they're heading straight for danger.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/12LxuRKXxQkeS5HIxSX2qR045UR.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-29\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Tracky's Special Invitation\",\"overview\":\"While SchoolB seeks suggestions on where to take the kids for their activity, Tracky looks for ways to make his farm look spiffy.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e2lmoNlflsoFtT1GlHFqjU7QNMl.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-05\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"I Want to Go to Sea\",\"overview\":\"Anxious to explore the sea, Rody stows away with Marine. When bad weather hits, Rody takes a spill and the Rescue Team must save their friend.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/snRjraqSnQURRrymlDHsqGJjb3k.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-06\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Move Out! Battle in the Woods (1)\",\"overview\":\"Helly stumbles upon a trap in the Wildlife Reserve that leads the Rescue Team on an important mission across Brooms Town and beyond.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2DhYJ2taHb12gplsq5c31VFMeFE.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-12\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Move Out! Battle in the Woods (2)\",\"overview\":\"Mark and Bucky help the Rescue Team work together to pursue the dangerous Poacher before he can make yet another escape.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yRz3b5ogLvAaHEbDwxfLylglaVO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-13\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Please Accept My Apology\",\"overview\":\"While in the middle of a game of hide-and-seek with Lifty, Max leaves to run an errand. Lifty is furious, and Max must find a way to apologize.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s60DnSH1DoTAY9nYA5rpsn0wg9J.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-19\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Bruner's Birthday Secret\",\"overview\":\"Bruner really wants a particular present for his birthday. When his friends refuse to tell him what they bought, Bruner goes searching for clues.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5pOjvrUO8TPeyP6bVuwN7be2MLr.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-20\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Miracle at Tracky's Farm\",\"overview\":\"When a drought hits, Jin asks that everyone cut back on their water usage. As Tracky's farm begins to suffer, the Rescue Team reaches out for help.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lML1KoicT3M0bSaHXrhTKef92TW.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-26\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Boom! Crash! Danger!\",\"overview\":\"As a lightning storm brews, Mini, Benny and Rody head to Galaxy Hill for a closer look. When disaster strikes, the Rescue Team must heed the call.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nf3iwcH3OQwrgqZE9j3QMvdSGL5.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-27\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Camp's Secret Plan\",\"overview\":\"Camp visits Brooms Town a day early but keeps it a secret. Later, when he doesn't appear, his friends start to worry something may have happened.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pK4nbjjVbcMH8oUO8jwII7BI1Oh.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-02\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"Fishing Commotion\",\"overview\":\"Desperate to catch a fish for Ms. Belle, Lety stays up too late and shows up tired for work, where he's even more clumsy than usual.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/owYgUXsuFQitSfJ22L0Ui9EL6RD.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-03\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Thank You, Roy\",\"overview\":\"Roy learns the importance of resting his body when he pushes himself too hard during a hectic workday and makes an injury worse.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sC8rLQTAe4JXBq7AIgbepV91uW0.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-09\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"Disappearance of Spooky\",\"overview\":\"After Jin invents an invisible laser machine, Spooky sneaks in and experiments on himself. Unfortunately, when he needs help, nobody can see him.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jVbiKDqBcEfrnURdMvCm5DBzTEB.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-10\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"Helping Each Other When Things Are Difficult\",\"overview\":\"Dump and Bruner head to the harbor to pick up a shipment, but bickering over who should carry what leads to a preventable accident.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xZxgR8wMVPHVDwbleI3gRN3pRaC.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-16\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"Tracky's Present\",\"overview\":\"Grateful for Mr. Wheeler's kindness, Tracky brings him a basket of raspberries. Meanwhile, residents hear rumors of a snake sighting.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b2AoRbAKf8DW96SDu5OW5Q7TDx3.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-17\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"The Brooms Town Railroad Station\",\"overview\":\"The Rescue Team reports for duty when Lifty, Terry, Bruner and Dump -- feeling rushed to reach their destinations -- get into a jam near Frog Bridge.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k0wmpo0GQRJJ0f5uCr43yTjflhc.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-23\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":26,\"name\":\"Our Fabulous New Friend\",\"overview\":\"To celebrate the completion of the railway station, Mr. Builder plans a party with a special surprise that has Spooky beyond excited.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pQk6aE2AbV1ScX8ipAI61CMrfEa.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-24\",\"runtime\":13}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2011-02-28\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}